    "_summary": "The classic arcade game made 100% with PlayMaker.",
    "_description": "# Asteroids\n\nA faithful re-creation of the classic arcade game.\n\n{height=300}![screenshot](Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker/Editor/Addons/Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker.samples.asteroids.jpg)\n\n## Features\n\nThis sample game shows how to:\n\n- Control the flow of game screens.\n- Use Sprites and collision shapes for the player and enemies.\n- Use 2D Physics to move objects and detect collisions.\n- Use input to control a player spaceship.\n- Wrap objects across screen edges.\n- Build random levels from prefabs and detect when a level is cleared.\n- Spawn enemies periodically.\n- Spawn more challenging enemies at higher scores.\n- Display a score and add points to it.\n- Track player lives and add bonus lives.\n- End the game when the player has no lives left.\n\n## Reference\n\n- Player [Input actions](action:InputGetAxis).\n- Using [Input controls](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/fsm-editor/variables-inspector/#exposing-inputs-and-outputs) to customize prefabs.\n- [Global variables](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/welcome/core-concepts/variables/#global-variables) and [events](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/welcome/core-concepts/events/#global-events).\n- Global events with [attached data](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/welcome/core-concepts/events/#event-data).\n- [Broadcasting a global event](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/actions/event-actions/broadcast-event/).\n- [Getting event data](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/welcome/core-concepts/events/#getting-event-data) from a collision event (e.g., the hit object).\n- [Sending a global event to a GameObject](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/actions/event-actions/send-event-to-game-object/).\n",
